		"content":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">榆林市榆神煤炭榆树湾煤矿有限公司主运系统煤流智能调速系统改造项目</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">公告</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<h2 align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">条件和方法</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1.1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">条件</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">榆林市榆神煤炭榆树湾煤矿有限公司主运系统煤流智能调速系统改造项目</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已具备</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">条件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">经</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">陕西榆林能源集团有限公司</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">批准，现对该货物项目实施公开采购活动，公开邀请合格</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">参加本项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购竞争</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;\">1.2</span><a name=\"_Hlk132968605\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">方式</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自愿</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标</span></span></p>\n<h2 align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内容和范围</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;\">2.1项目概况：榆林市榆神煤炭榆树湾煤矿有限公司主运系统煤流智能调速系统改造项目。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;\">2.2交货期：自合同签订生效后90日内到货,并完成安装调试。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;\">2.3交货地点：榆林市榆神煤炭榆树湾煤矿有限公司招标人指定地点。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">货物质量标准或主要技术性能指标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：满足相关行业标准及要求以及</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">第二章采购需求</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的要求。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内容和</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">范围：榆林市榆神煤炭榆树湾煤矿有限公司主运系统煤流智能调速系统改造项目，具体供货范围和工作范围详见招标文</span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">件第</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">章</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采购需求</span></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></strong></span></p>\n<h2 align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资格要求</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.1</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须具有独立承担民事责任能力，在中华人民共和国境内依法注册的法人或其他组织</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供有效的营业登记证明文件</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.2</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须具备建设行政主管部门核发的电子与智能化工程专业承包二级及以上资质</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">并在人员、设备、资金等方面具备相应的施工能力</span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.3</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须具有合格有效的安全生产许可证。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人</span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">须</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年1月1日至投标截止之日（以合同签订时间为准），</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">单项业绩</span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同金额不低于</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">500万元</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">智能化改造或配电改造安装类似项目</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1份。</span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">提供</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">合同复印件及</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">竣工验收资料</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，合同复印件须至少包含合同买卖双方签字盖章页、合同金额、合同签订日期、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">物资名称、规格型号</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或关键技术参数等信息。对于提供合同不清晰、信息不全，字体有明显修改、加粗等现象，视为无效业绩）。注：投标人不能将与其有隶属或组织关系的母公司、子公司或参股关联公司的业绩作为自己的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业绩。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5</span><span class=\"16\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人须提供赋码后</span></span><span class=\"16\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">202</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年度财务审计报告（经审计的资产负债表、现金流量表、利润表（损益表））等资料，提供的财务审计报告需在注册会计师行业统一监管平台（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">http://acc.mof.gov.cn/）报备可查询并提供网页查询截图。注：202</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年至今新成立公司须提供银行资信证明</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人具有良好的商业信誉，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">没有处于被责令停业、财产未被接管或冻结</span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">7</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人没有受到有关行政执法部门处罚暂停或取消投标资格（黑名单）</span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人不得列入信用中国（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://www.creditchina.gov.cn/xinyongfuwu/shixinheimingdan/）严重失信主体名单；不得在中国裁判文书网（http://wenshu.court.gov.cn/）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">近三年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2023年7月1日至今）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有行贿犯罪记录（被执行人包括投标人、法定代表人）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在控股、管理关系的不同单位，不得参加同一标段投标或者未划分标段的同一招标项目投标；否则均按废标处理；</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3.</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标不接受联合体投标</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">4.</span></strong><strong><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资格审查方法</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本次招标采用资格后审的方法对</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标人</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">资格进行审查，资格评审的条件、标准、方法详见</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">文件</span></span><span class=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<h2 align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">招标</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">文件的获取</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取时间</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">21</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">00</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">至</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">09</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">29</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">18</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">0</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（北</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">京</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">获取方式</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本项目通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">榆能集团电子采购交易平台</span><a href=\"../\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">//dzsw.sxylny.com/</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(建议使用谷歌浏览器)提供投标人注册、CA证书、报名、下载采购文件、上传投标文件、澄清说明和补正等功能</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。未在平台注册的投标人须访问</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">榆能集团电子采购交易平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">https://dzsw.sxylny.com/完成注册、办理CA证书等有关操作，操作步骤详见平台首页-服务专区</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">供应商注册手册，供应商操作手册</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">榆能集团电子采购交易平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">客服电话</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">400-855-85</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">05</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(转1))</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。备注</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">办理</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA证书的供应商方可完成项目报名、投标等</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">操</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">作，办理</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA证书需2-3个工作日，请供应商提前办理，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以免</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">影响正常投标，</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">CA证书收费标准及办理流程详见平台首</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">页</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&rarr;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">服务中心</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&rarr;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">平台规则中附件。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;\">5.3平台技术服务费收取：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中标人须向平台运营商按如下标准和规定缴纳平台技术服务费：平台技术服务费不区分货物、服务和工程类别，收费标准以中标金额为计费基数，执行定额收费标准，具体缴费程序及收费标准详见平台首页</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">&rarr;帮助中心&rarr;平台规则中平台技术服务费-收费细则。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;\">5.4榆能集团电子采购交易平台服务热线</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;\">①客服热线：400-855-8505（转1）；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;\">②CA办理使用：010-58515511；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;\">③编标、开评标系统：19962105096、18792668829；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">④财务服务邮箱：ynjt_dzsw002@163.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<h2 align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6.</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">文件的递交</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">递交</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">文件</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">截止时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">同</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">投标</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">截</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">止时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2026</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">年</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">10</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">月</span><u>13</u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">日</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">9</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">30</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（北京时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体